Third-Party Notices
===================

This repository currently has no bundled third-party binary artifacts.

Language model
--------------
Phase 1 ships a tiny **synthetic** Traditional Chinese n-gram stub invented for
tests and demos (`StubNgramModel` in `boshiamy_core`). It is original content
of this project and licensed under Apache License 2.0 together with the rest of
the code.

It is **not** derived from proprietary Boshiamy / 嘸蝦米 data, and it is **not**
a production-grade corpus model.

Hook for a real model
---------------------
Implement the `LanguageModel` trait in `boshiamy_core` and construct
`CorrectionEngine::new(...)` with your offline model. If you later vendor an
open-license model (for example CC0 / Apache-2.0 / MIT n-gram or small LM
weights), list its name, license, and source URL in this file before committing
the weights.

Code tables
-----------
No real Boshiamy / 嘸蝦米 `.cin` or compiled code table is included. Only tiny
synthetic fixtures under `crates/boshiamy_core/tests/fixtures/` are present for
automated tests.
